<title>USA: Stafford Township, N.J., won by Fleet Securities.</title>
<headline>Stafford Township, N.J., won by Fleet Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fleet Securities, Inc said it won $8.280 million of Stafford Township, N.J., general improvement bonds, Series 1996, with a net interest cost of 5.59 percent.</p>
</text>
